{"seq":3,"slug":"philanthropy","title":"慈善","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-giving-pledge","title":"捐赠誓言","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-giving-pledge","wordCount":1362,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-great-giveaway","title":"伟大的捐赠","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/major-works/philanthropy/the-great-giveaway","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"慈善\">慈善</h1><p>在财富之外，巴菲特的慈善之举是他最崇高的代表作。本章考察这一壮举。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;捐赠誓言&quot;——他发起的、号召全球富豪回馈社会的历史性倡议。第二篇文档讲述&quot;伟大的捐赠&quot;,呈现他把毕生财富几乎悉数捐献的崇高之举与财富观。</p>\n"}